WEBVTT

00:11:29.746 --> 00:11:32.954
So I think, you know, rethinking is
really important and relearning is

00:11:33.246 --> 00:11:36.787
a weird Sisyphean inevitability that
I don't think we can avoid.

00:11:37.621 --> 00:11:41.496
But I feel like, you know,
the drive to do.

00:11:42.537 --> 00:11:45.996
What I do like I'm guessing the drive
for you to do what you do,

00:11:46.371 --> 00:11:51.246
you do it because you feel compelled
to share a point of view, an idea,

00:11:51.579 --> 00:11:54.246
a feeling, an insight, a question,

00:11:54.246 --> 00:11:55.996
something you might not even
understand the answer to.

00:11:56.787 --> 00:11:58.121
And you just feel compelled to do it.

00:11:58.121 --> 00:12:01.662
And I think I start everything desperately
,